# Netlify redirects for the NeoBank dashboard.
#
# This is a Next.js 16 App Router app. Netlify serves it through the OpenNext
# runtime (zero config): SSR, route handlers, middleware and dynamic routes all
# work without a catch-all rewrite.
#
# Do NOT enable the classic SPA fallback below for an SSR build. `/* /index.html
# 200` shadows every Next.js route and serves index.html for pages the server
# should render.
#
# Enable it ONLY if next.config.ts switches to `output: "export"` (static HTML)
# and Netlify publishes the generated `out/` directory:
#
# /*    /index.html   200
